    "detailed_description": "<strong>What is it?</strong><br>WordWar is a couch multiplayer game from 1 to 4 players.<br>Its particular aspect is that it combines word game goals with chaotic couch game dynamics.<br>In fact, the players have to fight for the letters scattered in the Arena in order to build words and score points<br><br><strong>What it looks like?</strong><br>In WordWar you will chase the opponents to steal the letters they have and try to carry them on your team's base.<br>A big part of the game is based on throwing the letters around, to your teammate (pass) or to your opponents (hit) - this last part is the funniest one\ud83d\ude02<br>You can write any word with 2 or 3 letters, so be creative!",
